{
  "id": "Lyo.Formatter.Algorithms",
  "name": "Lyo.Formatter.Algorithms",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "Optional formatter addon that runs Algo(\"key\") through Lyo.Algorithms.",
  "description": "Registers an IFormatterExpressionEvaluator that understands Algo(\"key\") and score(\"key\") by calling IAlgorithmRegistry. Lyo.Formatter does not reference Algorithms. Job, Api, and AddFormatterService stay unchanged until a host calls AddFormatterAlgorithms().",
  "features": [
    "**Opt-in.** AddFormatterAlgorithms after AddAlgorithms and AddFormatterService. Hosts that skip it keep the built-in DateTime and LINQ expressions.",
    "**Latest key.** The token is the whole expression: {Algo(\"attack.physical\")} or {score(\"fish.score\")}. Pins and labels stay on AlgorithmRef in application code.",
    "**Same registry.** A cold key is loaded once. Later formats hit the compiled delegate."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Format a catalog algorithm",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddAlgorithms();\nservices.AddMemoryAlgorithmStore();\nservices.AddFormatterService();\nservices.AddFormatterAlgorithms();\n\nvar text = formatter.Format(\"{Algo(\\\"attack.physical\\\")}\", new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Atk\"] = 10d });"
    }
  ],
